    "iCloud Drive/TaptionBackup에 달마다 파일 하나로 압축·암호화해 저장합니다. 자동으로 올리지 않으며, ‘지금 백업’을 누를 때만 올립니다.|Saved to iCloud Drive/TaptionBackup as one compressed, encrypted file per month. Nothing is uploaded automatically; it runs only when you tap Back up now." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud Drive/TaptionBackupに、月ごとに圧縮・暗号化した1つのファイルとして保存されます。自動ではアップロードされず、今すぐバックアップをタップしたときだけ実行されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每月保存为一个压缩加密文件，存放在 iCloud 云盘/TaptionBackup。不会自动上传，仅在你点按“立即备份”时运行。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每個月以一個壓縮加密檔案儲存到 iCloud 雲碟/TaptionBackup。不會自動上傳，只有在你點一下「立即備份」時才會執行。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wird in iCloud Drive/TaptionBackup gesichert, pro Monat eine komprimierte, verschlüsselte Datei. Es wird nichts automatisch hochgeladen; es läuft nur, wenn du auf „Jetzt sichern“ tippst."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enregistré dans iCloud Drive/TaptionBackup, un fichier compressé et chiffré par mois. Rien n'est envoyé automatiquement ; la sauvegarde ne se lance que si vous touchez Sauvegarder maintenant."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Salvato in iCloud Drive/TaptionBackup come un file compresso e cifrato al mese. Non viene caricato nulla in automatico: parte solo quando tocchi Esegui backup ora."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se guarda en iCloud Drive/TaptionBackup como un archivo comprimido y cifrado al mes. No se sube nada automáticamente; solo se ejecuta al tocar Copiar ahora."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Salvo em iCloud Drive/TaptionBackup, em um arquivo compactado e criptografado por mês. Nada é enviado automaticamente; só roda quando você toca em Fazer backup agora."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lưu vào iCloud Drive/TaptionBackup, mỗi tháng một tệp nén và mã hóa. Không có gì được tải lên tự động; chỉ chạy khi bạn nhấn Sao lưu ngay."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Disimpan ke iCloud Drive/TaptionBackup sebagai satu file terkompresi dan terenkripsi per bulan. Tidak ada yang diunggah otomatis; hanya berjalan saat Anda mengetuk Cadangkan sekarang."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "บันทึกไว้ใน iCloud Drive/TaptionBackup เป็นไฟล์บีบอัดและเข้ารหัสหนึ่งไฟล์ต่อเดือน จะไม่อัปโหลดอัตโนมัติ และทำงานเมื่อแตะ สำรองข้อมูลเดี๋ยวนี้ เท่านั้น"
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud Drive/TaptionBackup में हर महीने की एक संपीड़ित, एन्क्रिप्टेड फ़ाइल के रूप में सहेजा जाता है। कुछ भी अपने-आप अपलोड नहीं होता; यह सिर्फ़ तब चलता है जब आप अभी बैकअप लें दबाते हैं।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud Drive를 사용할 수 없습니다. iCloud Drive가 켜져 있는지 확인해 주세요.|iCloud Drive is unavailable. Check that iCloud Drive is turned on." : {
