    "지하철역·버스정류장·기차역·공항·항구를 지도에서 관리합니다.|Manage subway stations, bus stops, train stations, airports, and harbors on the map." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
